  "body": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hant/\">繁體中文</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-blue-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/\">English</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">HokkienLang 是一个透过〈<strong><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">東寧音<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.1em;left: 0.8em\">당ˉ롕임ˆ</rt></ruby></strong></strong>〉来探索<strong>闽南语</strong>（又称作<strong>福建话</strong>、<strong>台湾话</strong>）的空间——这是一套专为让闽南语的发音、声调和语音变化更容易视觉化而设计的书写系统。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">东宁音，为何？</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">闽南语（泉漳片）在全球有超过 2,500 万使用人口，却仍极少见于日常书写。<strong><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">漢字<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">한`띠ˉ</rt></ruby></span></strong>虽能保留词义与词汇辨识，却不一定能清楚呈现实际读音；罗马拼音虽能清楚标示语音，却与<strong>汉字文化圈</strong>的书写传统相去较远。</p>\n\n\n\n<img src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/458d8131d783-vowels-illustration.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3034\" style=\"width:125px;height:auto;float:right\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"/zh-hans/learn/introduction/\">东宁音</a></strong>以谚文为基础，利用音节方块呈现闽南语的音节、声调与变调，并主要用于汉字—谚文混写：汉字承载词义与词汇身分，谚文则在需要时明确标示读音。如须完全采用表音书写，仍可采用纯谚文（如教育用途上）。</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">类似的字形，不同的语言</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">以 “学生” 这个词为例：</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">韩语：<strong>학생</strong> (<em>hak-saeng</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">闽南语（东宁音）：<strong><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">學生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.72em\">학솅ˆ</rt></ruby></span></strong> (<em>hak-siêng</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">两者看似相近，读音却仍属闽南语。东宁音借鉴谚文的音节方块，尤其针对其<strong>声调与变调</strong>加以调整，使其契合闽南语音韵，同时也与汉字自然并用。</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">学习东宁音</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-bright-blue-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hans/learn/introduction/\">以中文（简）开始学习</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hant/learn/introduction/\">以中文（繁）開始學習</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-blue-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/learn/introduction/\">Start learning in English</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">变调解析</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">想要获取更进阶的知识吗？<br>点选下方来探索闽南语韵律感背后的声调机制。</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hans/learn/tone-sandhi/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">闽南语的变调规则</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">文学读物</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-small-font-size wp-duotone-unset-2\"><img data-attachment-id=\"3032\" data-permalink=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/the-egg/\" data-orig-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/the-egg.png\" data-orig-size=\"707,841\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Egg\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/the-egg.png?w=707\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-3032\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/a544aeacfa20-the-egg.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" loading=\"lazy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-1 wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/zh-hant/read/stories/the-egg/\"><b><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"nn̄g\">卵<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.4em;left: 0.4em\">능ˉ</rt></ruby></b></a></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><img data-attachment-id=\"7199\" data-permalink=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/%e7%9b%ae%e9%8c%84-directory/naikiengki/\" data-orig-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/naikiengki.png\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1024\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"naikiengki\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/naikiengki.png?w=1024\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-7199 size-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/c9a8f25fedf3-naikiengki.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" loading=\"lazy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\"><b><a href=\"/read/literature/lychee-mirror/\" title=\"荔鏡記\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"nai-kièng-ki\">荔鏡記<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.4em;left: 1.6em\">내곙`기</rt></ruby></a></b><span style=\"display: inline-block;text-align: center;width: 100%;font-size: 0.5em\">（建置中）</span></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-default\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">歌曲</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote has-medium-font-size\"><blockquote><p>从经典金曲到新生乐团，这里集结了台湾与南洋的歌谣创作，让每段旋律里的温度，为你细细收藏生活里各种独特的心情。</p></blockquote></figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">当代流行</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-63375db1 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/2025/07/09/向前走-형졩걀-諺文歌詞/\">向前走</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/浪溜嗹/\">浪流连</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/敢傻敢衝/\">敢傻敢冲</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/곻愛릐一擺/\">阁爱你一摆</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/헤비運將情歌/\">Happy!!! 运将情歌</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/一吋相思一吋淚/\">一吋相思一吋泪</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/寫一條歌寫릐꽈爾爾/\">写一条歌，写你我尔尔</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/愛情릐比꽈想에곻較偉大/\">爱情你比我想的阁较伟大</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">都市抒情</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/門/\">门</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/메삐메삐/\">Maybe Maybe</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/에흐로때디/\">Aphrodite (Αφροδίτη)</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/手捧一杯酒/\">手捧一杯酒</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">热播金曲</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/家後/\">家后</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/堅持/\">坚持</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/꽈問天/\">我问天</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/小雨傘/\">小雨伞</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/愛情챻챻/\">爱情恰恰</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/歡喜就好/\">欢喜就好</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/愛拚才會贏/\">爱拼才会赢</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/酒後에心聲/\">酒后的心声</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">深夜独白</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/無眠/\">无眠</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/落雨聲/\">落雨声</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/浪子回頭/\">浪子回头</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/阿媽에話/\">阿嬤的话</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/生份에릐/\">生分的你</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/再會랗心愛에無緣에人/\">再会啦心爱的无缘的人</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">疗愈暖心</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layou